Exactly! Spikes are my favorite thing to do!

284
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,860
But it's better than not playing at all, right?

285
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:40,860
I want to stay on the court the longest.

286
00:18:46,860 --> 00:18:47,860
Oh man.

