296
00:19:17,860 --> 00:19:18,860
This is it.

297
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:19,860
Finish it!

298
00:19:19,860 --> 00:19:20,860
It doesn't matter!

299
00:19:20,860 --> 00:19:29,860
Where you hit it from!

300
00:19:29,860 --> 00:19:30,860
Where you hit it from!

