We won't let it through that easy!

302
00:19:36,860 --> 00:19:37,860
Check him out!

303
00:19:53,860 --> 00:19:55,860
Yo-oh!

304
00:19:55,860 --> 00:19:57,860
Oh, man! Holy crap!

305
00:20:01,860 --> 00:20:03,860
Upfront! Upfront!

306
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:06,860
Karasuno's tenacity is throwing an Anasaki into...

307
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:08,860
Go back! Go back! Go back! Hurry!

308
00:20:08,860 --> 00:20:10,860
Hurry!

309
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:27,860
Quick! Minus tempo! Back!

310
00:20:29,860 --> 00:20:31,860
This position!

311
00:20:33,860 --> 00:20:34,860
This timing!

312
00:20:34,860 --> 00:20:38,860
This angle!

313
00:20:41,860 --> 00:20:43,860
It's perfection!

314
00:21:04,860 --> 00:21:09,860
To-

315
00:21:09,860 --> 00:21:11,860
To

316
00:21:17,860 --> 00:21:19,860
To

317
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:21,860
To

318
00:21:21,860 --> 00:21:36,000
I think everyone else was surprised.

319
00:21:38,140 --> 00:21:39,860
But not us.

320
00:21:44,940 --> 00:21:47,860
In a battle that lasted a tenth of a second,

321
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:51,440
when the twins pulled out that fast back row attack,

322
00:21:51,860 --> 00:21:58,860
