323
00:22:02,860 --> 00:22:06,860
Speed is a very, very strong weapon.

324
00:22:06,860 --> 00:22:08,860
It's mesmerizing.

325
00:22:08,860 --> 00:22:10,860
It makes you look cool.

326
00:22:10,860 --> 00:22:12,860
It feels great.

327
00:22:12,860 --> 00:22:15,860
But it's not invincible.

328
00:22:15,860 --> 00:22:17,860
And they know that.

329
00:22:17,860 --> 00:22:20,860
